"id","yx5uxid5iuu4fa0gmn3xzh5nk","Box发布基于Nvidia Nemotron的新内容检索系统，通过嵌入向量技术提升企业级查询速度、准确性和成本效益。Nemotron在RTEB基准测试中表现突出，支持法律等专业场景的条款检索。系统依赖Box现有元数据与权限控制，需整合多技术实现。","source",{"_50":191,"_192":193},"publishedAt","selected",true,"TechCrunch · AI","firstParty",false,{"_195":196,"_11":197,"_18":19,"_15":16,"_198":199},"factId","fmcGIBFvf53s","Box Content Retrieval系统上线","representative",{"_183":184,"_11":28,"_25":185,"_186":200,"_188":19,"_189":190},{"_50":191,"_192":193},"participants48h",0,"newParticipants6h","recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_208":209,"_210":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
